==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm|en}} {{m|enm|agrounde}}, {{m|enm|on grounde||on ground}}, equivalent to {{prefix|a|ground|lang=en}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|aʊnd|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# {{label|en|nautical|of a normally floating craft}} Resting on the [[bottom]].
# {{label|en|1811}} Stuck fast, stopped, at a loss, ruined, like a boat that has run aground.

===Adverb===
{{en-adv|-}}

# {{label|en|nautical|of a normally floating craft}} Resting on the [[bottom]].

====Derived terms====
* [[run aground]]

